@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@requestToken = paste-the-RequestToken-value-from-the-first-response

### Get an antiforgery token before uploading
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/antiforgery

### Upload an image (replace ./sample.jpg with a local image path)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/analyze
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{requestToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----NsfwSharpBoundary

------NsfwSharpBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="sample.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample.jpg
------NsfwSharpBoundary--
